{{Codex|Infused with rare Orokin alloys, the Bronco Prime is a highly efficient weapon. Trading an increased clip size and damage for a lower rate of fire.}}

The '''Bronco Prime''' is the [[Prime]]d variant of the shotgun sidearm {{Weapon|Bronco}}, featuring a higher base damage and magazine size at the cost of a lower [[fire rate]] and [[reload speed]]. The Bronco Prime was added into the game in {{ver|9}}.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|5,000}}; it is also a [[weapon crafting ingredient]] for {{Weapon|Akbronco Prime}} (x2).
{{Checklist|nocategory=true|
* {{Weapon|Bronco Prime}} + {{Weapon|Bronco Prime}} → {{Weapon|Akbronco Prime}}
}}

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Impact}} damage.
*Can use the Bronco-exclusive {{M|Dizzying Rounds}} mod.

{{Advantages|class=Shotgun Sidearm|
*Tied with {{Weapon|Akbronco Prime}} for the third highest base damage of all shotgun-type secondaries, behind {{Weapon|Twin Rogga}} and alt-fire {{Weapon|Euphona Prime}}.
*Very high overall [[status chance]].
*Innate [[multishot]] of 7 pellets.
*Good ammo efficiency.
}}

{{Disadvantages|class=Shotgun Sidearm|
*Has linear damage falloff from 100% to 74% from 9m to 18m target distance (distances are affected by [[Projectile Speed]]).
*Wide pellet spread cone makes the weapon ineffective beyond short range.
}}

{{WeaponComparison|Bronco}}
{{WeaponComparison|Akbronco Prime|header=n}}

==Acquisition==
{{PrimeTable}}

==Crafting==
{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Notes==
*The Bronco Prime's high damage, high spread and high pellet count (with {{M|Barrel Diffusion}}) make it a good crowd thinner and control tool, particularly against the [[Infested]].
**Using {{M|Seeker|Seeker}} is recommended to increase its capability against large groups of enemies.
*{{M|Gunslinger}} (or {{M|Lethal Torrent}}) and {{M|Quickdraw}} may be valuable due to the relatively low rate of fire and reload speed, to increase the time spent shooting.
**Alternatively, due to the small magazine size, {{M|Semi-Pistol Cannonade}} may be used to significantly increase damage per shot and provide excellent ammo economy.

